values ('ap_physics_2', 10, '10.6', array['10.6']::text[], 'convention', 'Uniform field and motion between plates', 'Between two charged parallel plates with uniformly distributed electric charge the field is constant in magnitude and direction, except near the edges of the plates, so a charged particle between them undergoes constant acceleration and its motion shares characteristics with projectile motion in the gravitational field near Earth''s surface.', '[]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, 'published', 'generated-checked; extractor=anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5; batch=ap-physics-2-reference-u9-u11-2026-10-10; candidate=ap_physics_2-u10-r3-002; ced=10.6.A.3 and 10.6.A.3.ii: "undergoes constant acceleration and therefore its motion shares characteristics with the projectile motion"; product-owner-directed correction by the Claude session (David, 2026-10-10): the escalated row was corrected against its own CED evidence and re-checked by both independent checkers and the own-family veto')
on conflict (subject_key, owner_topic_code, kind, title) do nothing;
